      "message": "As a sidenote: I am not sure the clamping that was introduced is working as intended - dependencies such as bitflags are still getting pulled. That makes me unsure whether we want to stick with the clamping and go back to using just version numbers without `\u003d` if we may anyway need to deal with consequences of rolling crates in the dependency graph.",
