      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `\u003d` is necessary to avoid issues with cxx and png, and doesn\u0027t seem to be hurting other deps, so I think it\u0027s fine. We don\u0027t specify all dependencies and transitive dependencies for rust, just the top level ones. And that\u0027s fine I think.",
